note bottom of Ledger
  U18: positive earn/adjustment/refund entries form lots.
  Redemption consumes earliest expiry first;
  expiry applies only to the unspent amount of its lot.
  Refund is a new non-expiring credit.
end note
note bottom of Claim
  U19: one canonical case per request.
  Historic duplicates retain null caseKey;
  only the canonical case affects trust.
  Allegations never count as proven violations.
end note
note bottom of Provider
  N25: successful trust scans advance both timestamps,
  failed scans advance only attemptedAt.
  A policy change clears both watermarks.
end note
note bottom of Evidence
  U16: exact lookup uses referenceIndex;
  reference remains randomly encrypted.
  Migration backfills existing references.
end note
note bottom of Review
  N24: edit locks the review row, consumes allowance,
  increments contentRevision and queues matching evidence.
  Older pending evidence becomes superseded;
  moderation checks the matching revision under row lock.
  N21: admin status counts aggregate the full table;
  anomaly signals and calibration use the latest 1000 reviews.
end note
Request ..> Outbox : effects; payload association
EmailCheckpoint ..> User : bounded email backfill
EmailCheckpoint ..> Provider : invitation provider scope
note bottom of EmailCheckpoint
  U02: compare-write and checkpoint commit together.
  Verify full row/owner MAC coverage before strict reads.
  Production backfill and restore remain unverified.
end note
note bottom of OAuthCheckpoint
  U02: bounded compare-write and checkpoint commit together.
  Verify subject MAC by identity/user UUID and provider.
  Real KMS/restore and strict cutover remain unverified.
end note
note bottom of SecondaryCheckpoint
  U02: three nullable fields bind plaintext to user UUID.
  Compare-write and checkpoint commit together; full verify
  precedes opt-in strict read. Partial selects include binding.
end note
note bottom of VehicleCheckpoint
  U02: HMAC binds plaintext to vehicle and owner UUID.
  Bounded compare-write and checkpoint commit together; full verify
  precedes opt-in strict read. Null optional fields have null binding.
end note
note bottom of HistoryCheckpoint
  U02: HMAC binds reason to history UUID, booking UUID and status.
  Bounded compare-write and full verify precede opt-in strict read.
  Account deletion clears reason and binding together.
end note
note bottom of BookingTextCheckpoint
  U02: HMAC binds each text field to booking UUID, client UUID,
  cabinet UUID and service UUID. Bounded compare-write and full
  verify precede opt-in strict read. Deletion clears text and MAC.
end note
note bottom of BookingRescheduleCheckpoint
  U02: HMAC binds resolution reason to request/booking/requester/
  resolver UUID and decision status. Compare-write and full verify
  precede opt-in strict read; deletion clears reason and MAC.
end note
note bottom of AutoCareRescheduleCheckpoint
  U02: proposal reason binds to reschedule/request/requester UUID;
  decision reason also binds resolver UUID and status. Bounded
  compare-write and full verify precede opt-in strict read.
end note
note bottom of QuoteCheckpoint
  U02: HMAC binds snapshot to quote/request/provider UUID and version.
  Account deletion rewrites each quote with its own encrypted redaction
  and binding. Full verify precedes opt-in strict read.
end note
note bottom of ChatReportCheckpoint
  U02: HMAC binds each moderation text to report/thread/reporter UUID.
  Status and assignment can change without breaking historical text.
  Bounded compare-write and full verify precede opt-in strict read.
end note
note bottom of ChatBlockCheckpoint
  U02: HMAC binds reason to block/thread/blocker/blocked-user UUID.
  Status can change without breaking the binding. Bounded compare-write
  and full verify precede opt-in strict read; deletion clears both.
end note
note bottom of EvidenceCheckpoint
  U02: HMAC binds reference/notes to evidence/provider UUID and kind.
  Read verifies reference against blind index. Backfill clears stale
  indexes after null redaction; full verify precedes opt-in strict read.
end note
note bottom of ProviderChangeCheckpoint
  U02: HMAC binds encrypted payload and review reason to request UUID,
  provider UUID, requester UUID and kind. Account deletion reseals each
  redacted payload with its own binding and clears reason with binding.
  Full verify precedes opt-in strict read.
end note
note bottom of AppealCheckpoint
  U02: HMAC binds reason and decisionReason to appeal UUID, subject,
  subjectId, submitter UUID and nullable provider UUID. Account deletion
  reseals each redacted reason and clears decision reason with binding.
  Full verify precedes opt-in strict read.
end note
note bottom of CatalogGapCheckpoint
  U02: four HMACs bind encrypted fields to gap UUID, requester UUID,
  nullable provider UUID and catalog slugs/price type. Account deletion
  reseals each redacted row and clears reviewReason with its binding.
  Full verify precedes opt-in strict read.
end note
note bottom of RepairEventCheckpoint
  U02: three HMACs bind encrypted title, notes and metadata to event UUID,
  request UUID and eventType. Account deletion reseals title and metadata
  for each row and clears notes with its binding. Full verify precedes
  opt-in strict read.
end note
note bottom of BroadcastRequestCheckpoint
  U02: HMAC binds issueDescription and nullable vehicleSnapshot to
  broadcast UUID, client UUID and definition UUID.
  marketId is excluded: the FK sets it to null on market deletion.
  Account deletion reseals redacted issue and clears vehicle snapshot
  with binding. Full verify precedes opt-in strict read.
end note
note bottom of BroadcastOfferCheckpoint
  U02: HMAC binds encrypted offerSnapshot to offer UUID, broadcast request
  UUID, provider UUID and location UUID. Account deletion reseals the
  redacted snapshot for each offer. Full verify precedes opt-in strict read.
end note
note bottom of GuaranteeClaimCheckpoint
  U02: HMAC binds summary and nullable resolution to claim UUID,
  request/client/provider UUID and claimType. Account deletion reseals
  redacted summary per row and clears resolution with binding.
  Full verify precedes opt-in strict read.
end note
note bottom of ProfileCheckpoint
  U02: name and non-null phone HMAC bind plaintext to user UUID.
  Compare-write and checkpoint commit together; full verify precedes
  opt-in strict read. Real KMS/restore remains unverified.
end note
note bottom of MessageCheckpoint
  U02: non-null body HMAC binds plaintext to message,
  request/thread and sender UUIDs and message kind.
  Compare-write and checkpoint commit together; full verify precedes
  opt-in strict read. Null body has null binding.
end note
note bottom of OfferCheckpoint
  U02: non-null offer HMAC binds decrypted JSON to message,
  request/thread and sender UUIDs and message kind.
  Compare-write and checkpoint commit together; full verify precedes
  opt-in strict read. Null offer has null binding.
end note
note bottom of ChatCheckpoint
  U02: subject HMAC binds plaintext to thread UUID,
  type and request/provider/client/creator UUIDs.
  Compare-write and checkpoint commit together; full verify precedes
  opt-in strict read. Account deletion rebinds redacted subjects.
end note
note bottom of BookingCheckpoint
  U02: booking JSON HMAC binds plaintext to request UUID,
  client/provider/location/definition UUIDs.
  Compare-write and checkpoint commit together; full verify precedes
  opt-in strict read. Account deletion clears snapshot and binding.
end note
note bottom of Evidence
  Пунктир — логическая связь, не FK.
  Reference lookup fix требует применения migration и проверки DB.
  Snapshot и FK нельзя восстанавливать из этой сокращённой карты:
  authoritative schema — entities + migrations.
end note
footer Полная schema также содержит market hierarchy / vehicles / capacity / appeals / audit
